  "updated_at": "2026-03-11",
  "bio": "Diego Corajes is a tattoo artist based in Zaragoza, Spain, known for mastering the traditional and illustrative styles that resonate with a diverse clientele. Operating out of Le Mat Tattoo in Barcelona, he maintains an impeccable standard of cleanliness, ensuring a safe and hygienic environment for every session. His dedication to maintaining a pristine workspace is matched only by his stunning tattoo artistry.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Zaragoza, Aragon, Spain"
}